1015 0 obj
<<
/A 3035 0 R
/Alt (The line graph displays two curves, train loss and val loss, plotted against epoch on the horizontal axis from 0 to 200. The vertical axis represents loss from 0 to 0.25. The train loss curve starts near 0.25, decreases sharply to approximately 0.1 at epoch 10, then gradually declines to about 0.06 at epoch 200. The val loss curve begins near 0.25, decreases sharply to approximately 0.15 at epoch 10, then gradually declines to about 0.1 at epoch 60, and remains relatively flat between 0.09 and 0.1 up to epoch 200. The train loss curve consistently remains below the val loss curve after epoch 10.)
/K 4
/P 47 0 R
/Pg 24 0 R
/S /Figure
/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
